    "detailed_description": "<h1>New Game &quot;Fortune Cookie&quot; has released</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Game &quot;Fortune Cookie&quot; has released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to play~</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wait, I'm playing a game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No, you are studying......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Elearning Development Intern&quot; is a very &quot;casual&quot; simulation game, you think you are about to do a front-end/back-end developer, and to the peak of life? No, you're joining an online education company in April to do content/service development, that's right! This is not a program job, it is about to do educational development . You will play as a educational developer intern and begin a three-month journey of hard working!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on your computer, have a cup of coffee, and have fun working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do proofreading, answer math questions, make learning materials, label the questions in the question bank system, listen to the share lecture, attend weekly meetings and goof off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then on June 30, welcome your formal defense, and then welcome the ending of intern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As for promotion and salary increase, have a better life...... wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plot Warning: For the day and week, you can probably guess what year it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pain warning: This game may involve forcing you to revisit the beauty of junior high math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Me</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello everyone, I'm Hao, an educator, lifelong learner and a game producer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm working hard to make some serious game, and some educational games which could influence our life in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, I wish you all a happy study time ~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, I mean, I wish you all a happy gaming time~</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wait, I'm playing a game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No, you are studying......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Elearning Development Intern&quot; is a very &quot;casual&quot; simulation game, you think you are about to do a front-end/back-end developer, and to the peak of life? No, you're joining an online education company in April to do content/service development, that's right! This is not a program job, it is about to do educational development . You will play as a educational developer intern and begin a three-month journey of hard working!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on your computer, have a cup of coffee, and have fun working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do proofreading, answer math questions, make learning materials, label the questions in the question bank system, listen to the share lecture, attend weekly meetings and goof off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then on June 30, welcome your formal defense, and then welcome the ending of intern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As for promotion and salary increase, have a better life...... wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plot Warning: For the day and week, you can probably guess what year it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pain warning: This game may involve forcing you to revisit the beauty of junior high math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Me</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello everyone, I'm Hao, an educator, lifelong learner and a game producer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm working hard to make some serious game, and some educational games which could influence our life in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, I wish you all a happy study time ~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, I mean, I wish you all a happy gaming time~</p>",
    "short_description": "An internship at an educational startup begins. No matter which computer is in front of you (inside or outside), you just need to, work and learn!",
